      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `9999d619d40381490a7ad9f61e5c4f746b155aaf91cdc5d11f1ece399224c96b--victims-of-crime-selected-offences-states-and-territories.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 8ae04ad7b186a929431f61b759c4c24e69f54c83b3d82ad2e0be9d5df4e993c6 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 10e929b2593d4cba4f11dcf70d9df42a8c2cf9d1557e7d9c97cd73e278b76c7b | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | e30809d3ebc1bbebc65fc192933e828a69a5f10a6b7d482d36103d2d902274c7 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | b4d3a936b251ecc49397ef57928ac9c65c8d35b46d7f8f05a6cf5c7200da54ad | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | 54f19f1e3c162fc33d12da33669e1b5cfa67d4c8133c0708527769757c5d37ce | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | bf460f3419481f865a2f0e510c4ac9dbcb1c49989adf05caba3b0eed71ce26db | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 6064645e99f3476bb4cb47bf6af651556b901f78b0d3b446afb7b2b51e472275 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
